-Neigh!

237
00:12:47,475 --> 00:12:48,809
…go!

238
00:12:53,898 --> 00:12:56,275
Chuck, chuck, chuck…

239
00:12:56,358 --> 00:12:57,818
Yo, where all the Ghosts at?

240
00:12:57,902 --> 00:12:59,195
Did they all just vanish?

241
00:12:59,278 --> 00:13:00,279
Chuck…

242
00:13:01,489 --> 00:13:04,366
Like, this will be a total breeze, no cap!

243
00:13:07,661 --> 00:13:09,497
-See ya, sweeties!
-See ya, sweeties!

244
00:13:09,580 --> 00:13:11,248
Hey, no fair!

245
00:13:11,332 --> 00:13:13,626
Goddamn it. Isn't there anything useful?

246
00:13:13,709 --> 00:13:15,294
Maybe our new toy?

247
00:13:15,377 --> 00:13:16,504
Yeah, use that!

248
00:13:16,587 --> 00:13:18,672
Time for our own little comeback.

249
00:13:18,756 --> 00:13:20,925
Huh? They're all over the town.

250
00:13:21,008 --> 00:13:22,426
No way! The town's really
fallen apart this badly?!

251
00:13:22,510 --> 00:13:23,511
This is…

252
00:13:24,386 --> 00:13:26,180
gonna be a big haul!

253
00:13:27,097 --> 00:13:29,058
-Buh-bye, babies.
-Buh-bye, babies.

254
00:13:29,141 --> 00:13:31,268
Do you hear a Karen, or is it just me?

255
00:13:31,352 --> 00:13:34,730
Again with the illegal gear.
Their cheating is off the charts.

256
00:13:34,813 --> 00:13:36,690
Shift's almost over… time to bounce.

257
00:13:43,197 --> 00:13:44,698
Wanna know what I think?

258
00:13:44,782 --> 00:13:48,327
Lowkey feels like we're about
to kick it into high gear!

259
00:13:50,162 --> 00:13:52,998
O evil spirit…

260
00:13:53,791 --> 00:13:56,502
born of those lost
between Heaven and Earth.

261
00:14:03,509 --> 00:14:05,636
May the thunderous power
from the garments…

262
00:14:08,722 --> 00:14:11,141
of these holy, tender-skinned youths…

263
00:14:13,269 --> 00:14:14,853
cleanse your filth and foulness,

264
00:14:15,896 --> 00:14:17,106
corruption and blight…

265
00:14:18,357 --> 00:14:20,150
be shattered into dust

266
00:14:20,734 --> 00:14:22,736
and return you to Heaven and Earth!

267
00:14:28,492 --> 00:14:29,827
Repent!

268
00:14:33,205 --> 00:14:35,165
I think they just overtook us.

269
00:14:35,249 --> 00:14:37,668
Jesus Christ!
We're gonna lose at this rate!

270
00:14:37,751 --> 00:14:38,877
Neigh!

271
00:14:38,961 --> 00:14:42,840
You there! We ain't got time
for nomming our way to Candy Mountain.

272
00:14:43,465 --> 00:14:44,633
Wait.

273
00:14:44,717 --> 00:14:47,428
The Demon Fusion and Split Switch!
Forgot we bought this too.

274
00:14:52,016 --> 00:14:54,560
Huh? Why does my mouth taste like grass?

275
00:14:54,643 --> 00:14:56,061
We'll get to that later!

276
00:14:56,145 --> 00:14:58,022
No time to lose. You gotta help us!

277
00:14:58,856 --> 00:15:01,483
What's this?
You want the demons to help you?

278
00:15:01,567 --> 00:15:04,361
Oh, how the mighty have fallen.

279
00:15:04,445 --> 00:15:07,948
If you know, you know, right?
And I know losers when I see 'em.

280
00:15:08,032 --> 00:15:11,118
The victory is totally palpable.

281
00:15:11,201 --> 00:15:15,080
I almost feel bad for them.
But it could also just be gas.

282
00:15:15,789 --> 00:15:16,790
What was that?

283
00:15:18,125 --> 00:15:19,710
Demons?

284
00:15:22,338 --> 00:15:24,214
Go choke on your own bulges, shitheads!

285
00:15:24,298 --> 00:15:25,883
What's this?

286
00:15:25,966 --> 00:15:27,509
Attacking on both sides?

287
00:15:27,593 --> 00:15:29,345
-How hilarious!
-How hilarious!

288
00:15:33,932 --> 00:15:35,267
They split into two.

289
00:15:36,185 --> 00:15:37,311
It's a transformer!

290
00:15:38,062 --> 00:15:40,397
-You cheating little rats!
-You cheating little rats!

291
00:16:06,840 --> 00:16:11,553
Angels teaming up with demons?
It's a violation of Heavenly law.

292
00:16:11,637 --> 00:16:14,056
Heaven's rules?
I couldn't care less!

293
00:16:14,139 --> 00:16:18,310
Mmm yeah, see… I'm a proud bitch,
so rules and strings? Not my thing.

294
00:16:18,394 --> 00:16:20,312
Dinner's ready, dear.

295
00:17:16,034 --> 00:17:17,828
They're coming! What is that?

296
00:17:18,954 --> 00:17:20,247
That…

297
00:17:20,330 --> 00:17:22,750
is what happens when you kill
too many Ghosts too quickly.

298
00:17:22,833 --> 00:17:25,711
It's an amalgamation
of Ghost on Ghost on Ghost.

299
00:17:25,794 --> 00:17:28,964
It's one Giant Ghost resonating
to the fear of many Ghosts!

300
00:17:29,047 --> 00:17:30,299
Holy crap!

301
00:17:31,383 --> 00:17:32,843
This has gotten way out of hand.

302
00:17:32,926 --> 00:17:35,053
But we're pretty much equal
in terms of coins.

303
00:17:35,137 --> 00:17:36,680
So, according to rules,

304
00:17:36,764 --> 00:17:39,433
whoever kills that one first, wins!

305
00:17:39,516 --> 00:17:40,517
Exactly!

306
00:17:41,101 --> 00:17:44,813
Bruh, the thought of being as mid as them,
like, totally gives me the ick!

307
00:17:44,897 --> 00:17:46,982
Absolutely not. Hard pass!

308
00:17:47,065 --> 00:17:49,651
-Ick!
-Ick!

309
00:17:58,410 --> 00:18:00,662
-That's it.
-Yep, we're done here.

310
00:18:03,999 --> 00:18:05,375
Oh, hell nah.

311
00:18:05,459 --> 00:18:09,171
They're adding everything
in the Heaven's Online Store to cart.

312
00:18:09,254 --> 00:18:10,547
What is that?

313
00:18:10,631 --> 00:18:14,051
That's the Double Triple Sextuple
Heavenly Cannon.

314
00:18:14,134 --> 00:18:16,762
We're fuckin' done for
if they shoot somethin' that big!

315
00:18:17,679 --> 00:18:21,099
Let's buy some things ourselves
on the Hell's Online Store!

316
00:18:21,183 --> 00:18:22,559
No battery?

317
00:18:22,643 --> 00:18:26,188
No good… No good either…
That's all there is!

318
00:18:26,271 --> 00:18:27,564
-Need a hand?
-You?

319
00:18:27,648 --> 00:18:29,358
Still got a consumer itch to scratch?

320
00:18:29,441 --> 00:18:32,653
Get in now while everything's
only three times the price!

321
00:18:32,736 --> 00:18:34,655
Fine! Gimme all you got!

322
00:18:34,738 --> 00:18:35,989
Thanks, bestie!

323
00:18:36,073 --> 00:18:37,825
It's illegal, circumvent,
and totes demonic!

324
00:18:37,908 --> 00:18:39,159
Hell yeah!

325
00:18:39,243 --> 00:18:41,370
And it comes with a new
costume for her pleasure!

326
00:18:42,496 --> 00:18:47,835
We, the Holy Twins, Angels of Heaven,
descended to cleanse the Earth.

327
00:18:51,088 --> 00:18:56,510
We, the Unholy Twins, Demons of Darkness,
emerged to scourge the Earth.

328
00:19:04,184 --> 00:19:06,895
O evil spirits,
caught between light and darkness,

329
00:19:08,647 --> 00:19:11,024
adrift and aimless upon the Earth.

330
00:19:13,110 --> 00:19:15,904
We shed our dues, our debts, our dignity,

331
00:19:17,072 --> 00:19:19,658
to wield anew the thunderous lightning.

332
00:19:22,286 --> 00:19:25,163
With it, we shall rend and tear,
torment and smite.

333
00:19:26,582 --> 00:19:29,001
We shall burn, impale, and
grind thee beneath our heel.

334
00:19:31,378 --> 00:19:34,089
It shall be cast to the farthest bounds,

335
00:19:35,549 --> 00:19:38,302
beyond the cradle from whence it came.

336
00:19:40,929 --> 00:19:42,431
Repent!

337
00:19:44,975 --> 00:19:46,852
Return to the dark!

338
00:19:50,606 --> 00:19:51,857
What the helly?

339
00:19:56,987 --> 00:19:58,780
I mean…

340
00:19:58,864 --> 00:20:00,240
Like…

341
00:20:00,324 --> 00:20:02,242
-We're so cooked!
-We're so cooked!

342
00:20:07,372 --> 00:20:08,957
-For real?
-I can't even…

343
00:20:19,635 --> 00:20:22,512
Jackpot!

344
00:20:25,849 --> 00:20:27,726
They did it!

345
00:20:31,772 --> 00:20:34,107
Bruh… This cannot be happening right now.

346
00:20:34,191 --> 00:20:37,486
I mean… Like…

347
00:20:37,569 --> 00:20:39,363
We just took the fattest L!

348
00:20:39,446 --> 00:20:40,989
<i>You two!</i>

349
00:20:41,073 --> 00:20:44,284
<i>What in the Heavens are you doing?</i>

350
00:20:48,080 --> 00:20:49,164
Your Highness!

351
00:20:49,247 --> 00:20:50,415
Uncle Ramie?

352
00:20:50,499 --> 00:20:54,670
Panty, Stocking, please excuse my boys.

353
00:20:54,753 --> 00:20:57,255
I do apologize
for their raising havoc on Earth

354
00:20:57,339 --> 00:20:59,049
and getting in the way of your work.

355
00:20:59,132 --> 00:21:01,301
-Nah, we're cool. How's it going?
-This was their doing!

356
00:21:01,385 --> 00:21:05,347
Now you listen here. Panty and Stocking
are the daughters of the King.

357
00:21:05,430 --> 00:21:07,891
And you, oh adjunctive ones,
are merely the King's nephews.

358
00:21:07,975 --> 00:21:09,935
There are limits to your station!

359
00:21:10,018 --> 00:21:13,855
And what's this?
Wasting money on more expensive gadgets?

360
00:21:15,983 --> 00:21:20,529
Panty, Stocking, I will take care
of things in Heaven's court

361
00:21:20,612 --> 00:21:23,073
and make sure
your Heaven Licenses are reinstated.

362
00:21:23,156 --> 00:21:26,118
Could you find it in your hearts
to forgive my sons this one time?

363
00:21:26,201 --> 00:21:27,244
Yeah, we can do that.

364
00:21:27,327 --> 00:21:29,121
Let bygones be bygones!
My name is Garter－

365
00:21:29,204 --> 00:21:33,458
Then, until we meet again!
Behave well, Panty and Stocking!

366
00:21:33,542 --> 00:21:34,584
See ya!

367
00:21:34,668 --> 00:21:35,877
Bye-bye, Uncle Ramie!

368
00:21:35,961 --> 00:21:37,421
That was truly the hand of God.

369
00:21:37,504 --> 00:21:38,547
God Hand!

370
00:21:39,172 --> 00:21:41,133
Looks like it all worked out in the end.

371
00:21:41,216 --> 00:21:44,261
Yep. I think tonight we take this cash
and go crazy broadway style!

372
00:21:46,054 --> 00:21:49,016
Yoo-hoo! Later has come
for your Buy Now, Pay Later.

373
00:21:50,142 --> 00:21:53,770
And here's your receipt.
Ya'll drop by again sometime, okay?

374
00:21:55,397 --> 00:21:58,734
Fuck! Get back here!
Damn that thieving Gunsmith Bitch!

375
00:21:58,817 --> 00:22:02,571
Hey, Toilet Sisters,
don't forget that we did you a favor too.

376
00:22:03,196 --> 00:22:05,866
A pact with a demon never comes cheap.

377
00:22:05,949 --> 00:22:06,992
Another day of peace.

378
00:22:07,659 --> 00:22:09,286
The nerve of you two!

379
00:22:09,369 --> 00:22:11,663
Don't forget we found you
whinnying and munching weeds.

380
00:22:11,747 --> 00:22:13,957
Shoulda left the nags as a nag.

381
00:23:52,973 --> 00:23:55,976
Please forgive us, your Highness.

382
00:23:56,643 --> 00:23:59,146
On the contrary.
You have done well, my children.

383
00:23:59,229 --> 00:24:00,939
Everything went just as expected.

384
00:24:01,022 --> 00:24:04,943
And as for your little operation
against Panty and Stocking…

385
00:24:06,528 --> 00:24:08,697
-Please continue.
-As you wish!

386
00:24:08,780 --> 00:24:10,740
{\an8}Subtitle: Daisy Savage & Rychelle Brittain
